Problem description

We have run into situations where an RFP has been complete and is ready for submission close to the deadline and it appears to be a physical submission. This leads to us missing the submission all together because the mail time was unaccounted for.


Goal

The goal is to make it so physical submissions are marked and accounted for before too much work has been done on them.

Requirements

Find submission process in solicitation documents

Differentiate between online/E-submission and physical submission

Pull address from physical submission (should be used to populate FOIA address as well)

Physical Submission mark for opportunity

Sync opportunity mark with Linear Ticket Label (physical submission label is already made)

any other Ideas to reach the goal and reduce wasted time